---
title: "saleLifecycle (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_active: initialize() (no fixed endTime)
    q_active --> q_concluded: end() by operator/projectAdmin
    q_concluded --> q_refund: per-investor 14-day refund windows active
    q_refund --> q_tge: publishTgeDetails() after TGE
    q_tge --> q_supply: supplyTokens()
    q_supply --> q_distribution: claimTokenAllocation() with dual signatures
    q_distribution --> [*]: all investors claimed/vesting deployed

    q_active --> q_canceled: cancel()
    q_concluded --> q_canceled: cancel() (if tokens not supplied)
    q_canceled --> [*]: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()

    q_concluded --> q_capital_withdrawn: withdrawRaisedCapital() (early capital access)
    q_capital_withdrawn --> q_tge: publishTgeDetails()

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: SAFT-based authorization, no fixed timing
        INV-002: Per-investor refund windows (MiCA compliance)
    end note

    note right of q_capital_withdrawn
        INV-003: Early capital withdrawal locks vesting modifications
        INV-004: Cancellation after withdrawal requires capital return + fees
    end note

    note right of q_distribution
        INV-005: Dual signature auth for claims (allocation + vesting)
        INV-006: No Merkle trees; signature-based verification throughout
    end note
